# The Reference's MIDI page (tools/make_manual.py --renders): screens only. P1 played, a MIDI clock at 120 BPM:
# Setup 1 with Sync locked to it, then Details with the delay's Time as a note value.
notips
phones 1
tapkey w0
tap PLAY
wait 2000
clock 120
wait 9000
tap GLO
wait 1500
shot r-midi-0.png
tap FX
tap FX
wait 1500
shot r-midi-1.png
